<title>JAPAN: Keihan Elec Railway - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Keihan Elec Railway - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 57.96		vs	   54.71</p>
<p> Operating	    8.41		vs	    6.17</p>
<p> Current		3.74		vs	    2.31</p>
<p> Net		    2.26		vs	    1.71</p>
<p> EPS		    4.05 yen	  vs	    3.11 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    564 million	  vs	 553 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Keihan Electric Railway Co Ltd is a local railway operator linking Osaka and Kyoto.</p>
</text>
